        "Description": "47. It starts again.\r\ryour target is Claudio Parisi, the man who set Crossfire in motion. He was the client who hired us to eliminate the network surrounding Levin Tolkien. A respected chef by trade, Parisi built a web of wealthy contacts and hidden connections over the years. We now know he withheld crucial information about Black Veil. He is currently in Sapienza, attempting to disappear. Find Parisi, uncover what he knows, and eliminate him.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
